"keep the Mac awake with the lid closed" = "在闔蓋時讓 Mac 保持喚醒";
"switch closed-display mode with the session" = "隨工作階段切換闔蓋模式";
"pause AWDL (turn off the Wi-Fi AirDrop/Handoff radio hops)" = "暫停 AWDL（關閉 Wi-Fi 的 AirDrop/Handoff 無線跳頻）";
"macOS is asking for your administrator password to %@. The dialog may be titled “osascript”: that's Keepresso running the command, and nothing else is changed. To stop these prompts for good, install the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General)." = "macOS 正在要求您輸入系統管理員密碼，以便%@。對話方塊標題可能顯示為「osascript」：這是 Keepresso 在執行指令，不會變更其他任何項目。若要徹底停止這類要求，請安裝系統管理員輔助程式（偏好設定 ▸ 一般）。";
"Keepresso keeps your Mac awake on your terms. It lives in the menu bar near the clock, with no Dock icon. Click its cup any time to start or stop." = "Keepresso 依您的規則讓 Mac 保持喚醒，位於選單列時鐘旁，沒有 Dock 圖示。隨時點按它的咖啡杯即可開始或停止。";
"Pick one to set up matching triggers, or keep it manual and add your own later. You can change this any time in Preferences." = "選擇其中一項即可設定對應的觸發條件，或維持手動並之後再自行新增。您可隨時在偏好設定中變更此設定。";
"When on, the listed conditions control the session instead of the manual switch." = "開啟後，列出的條件將取代手動開關來控制工作階段。";
"Activation is controlled by triggers.\nEdit them in Preferences." = "啟用狀態由觸發條件控制。\n請在偏好設定中編輯。";
"Why each session started or stopped, newest first. Kept in memory; clears on relaunch." = "說明每個工作階段開始或停止的原因，最新的在最前面。僅保存在記憶體中，重新啟動後即清除。";
"Every app's live power assertions, not just Keepresso's, the same data pmset -g assertions prints." = "所有 App 目前的電源聲明，不只是 Keepresso 的，與 pmset -g assertions 顯示的資料相同。";
"A system-wide keyboard shortcut that starts or stops keep-awake from any app. Needs at least one modifier key." = "一組系統層級的鍵盤快速鍵，可從任何 App 開始或停止保持喚醒功能，至少需要一個修飾鍵。";
"Lets the Mac sleep once battery charge drops below this level, even mid-session, so it doesn't run flat." = "當電量降至此程度以下時，即使工作階段正在進行也讓 Mac 進入睡眠，以免電力完全耗盡。";
"Shows the remaining time next to the menu-bar icon during a timed session." = "在定時工作階段期間，於選單列圖示旁顯示剩餘時間。";
"Starts a session as soon as Keepresso launches, using the default duration. Ignored while triggers are controlling activation." = "Keepresso 啟動後立即以預設時長開始工作階段。當觸發條件正在控制啟用狀態時將略過此設定。";
"Reopen the first-run welcome, with quick one-click setup for how you use your Mac." = "重新開啟首次執行時的歡迎畫面，並依您使用 Mac 的方式提供一鍵快速設定。";
"Fires when a timed session expires, trigger conditions drop, or a low-battery pause kicks in, not when you stop it yourself. The action is off by default so a timed session never surprises you." = "會在定時工作階段到期、觸發條件不再成立，或因電量過低而暫停時執行，而非您自行停止時。此動作預設為關閉，讓定時工作階段不會讓您措手不及。";
"If that time already passed today, it means tomorrow." = "若該時間今天已經過去，則代表明天。";
"Runs past midnight into the next day." = "會跨越午夜延續到隔天。";
"Save your settings, triggers, and presets to a JSON file to back them up or move them to another Mac. Importing replaces your current configuration and ends any running session." = "將您的設定、觸發條件與預設集儲存為 JSON 檔案，以便備份或轉移到另一台 Mac。匯入將取代目前的設定，並結束任何進行中的工作階段。";
"Keeps the Mac awake while a partial-download file (.crdownload, .download, .part, and the like) exists in the chosen folder, then lets it sleep once the download finishes. Holds for 30 seconds between files in a batch." = "只要所選資料夾中存在未完成的下載檔案（如 .crdownload、.download、.part 等），就讓 Mac 保持喚醒；下載完成後即可讓 Mac 進入睡眠。同一批次的檔案之間會保持 30 秒。";
"Writes a tiny marker file on the chosen volume periodically to stop an external drive or NAS from spinning down." = "定期在所選磁碟區上寫入一個微小的標記檔案，避免外接硬碟或 NAS 停止轉動。";
"For a Mac with no monitor: creates a higher-resolution display so Screen Sharing and VNC look crisp instead of a fuzzy 1920 × 1080. It uses a private macOS API, so treat it as experimental and expect it may break on a macOS update. A hardware HDMI or DisplayPort dummy plug is a no-software alternative." = "適用於沒有螢幕的 Mac：建立解析度更高的虛擬螢幕，讓螢幕共享與 VNC 顯示清晰，而非模糊的 1920 × 1080。此功能使用 macOS 私有 API，請視為實驗性功能，且 macOS 更新後可能失效。硬體 HDMI 或 DisplayPort 假負載接頭則是不需軟體的替代方案。";
"Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag." = "使用電池時也會保持喚醒；闔蓋後螢幕本身仍會關閉。放入背包前請先關閉此功能。";
"The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "行事曆規則需要行事曆存取權（系統設定 ▸ 隱私權與安全性）";
"Wi-Fi rules need Location access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "Wi-Fi 規則需要定位服務存取權（系統設定 ▸ 隱私權與安全性）";
"Checks an always-on Mac (e.g. a headless Mac mini) needs. Keepresso can read these but can't change the system ones, so use the links and commands below." = "常保開機的 Mac（例如無螢幕的 Mac mini）所需的檢查項目。Keepresso 可讀取這些設定，但無法變更系統設定，請使用下方的連結與指令。";
"macOS hops the Wi-Fi radio off-channel for AWDL about once a second, which shows up as ping spikes mid-game or mid-stream. Diagnose it here, and pause AWDL for the session if it's the culprit." = "macOS 大約每秒會將 Wi-Fi 無線電切換到其他頻道以供 AWDL 使用，這會在遊戲或串流過程中造成 ping 值突增。您可以在此進行診斷，若確認是 AWDL 造成的，可在此工作階段中暫停 AWDL。";
"Pings 1.1.1.1 five times a second for 10 seconds and checks whether latency spikes on AWDL's once-a-second cadence." = "以每秒 5 次的頻率對 1.1.1.1 執行 ping，共 10 秒，並檢查延遲是否以 AWDL 每秒一次的節奏出現突增。";
"Counts only while a game (or a cloud-gaming app) is the active window, not just running in the background. Keeps holding for 5 minutes after you switch away." = "僅在遊戲（或雲端遊戲 App）為使用中視窗時才會計入，而非只是在背景執行。切換到其他 App 後仍會維持 5 分鐘。";
"How long the pause lingers after the game stops being the active window, so a quick alt-tab doesn't flap the radios. Shorter brings AirDrop and Handoff back faster; longer rides out launchers and loading screens." = "遊戲不再是使用中視窗後，暫停狀態會維持多久，避免快速切換視窗時無線電頻繁開關。時間較短可讓 AirDrop 與 Handoff 較快恢復；時間較長則可撐過啟動器與讀取畫面。";
"Posts a notification when a game is detected and AWDL pauses, and again when it resumes. A notice that your administrator password is needed is always sent (even behind a fullscreen game), regardless of this switch." = "偵測到遊戲並暫停 AWDL 時會發出通知，恢復時也會再次發出通知。無論此開關是否開啟，都一定會傳送需要輸入系統管理員密碼的提示（即使在全螢幕遊戲之下也一樣）。";
"Also tells macOS you're active while a session runs, so remote-desktop sessions, meeting presence (Teams, Slack), and corporate idle-logout don't mark you away. A plain keep-awake doesn't reach those. It only steps in once you've been idle a few seconds, so it never nudges the pointer while you're using the Mac or gaming. Off by default; some managed Macs flag simulated activity." = "工作階段進行期間，也會告知 macOS 您處於使用中狀態，讓遠端桌面工作階段、會議在線狀態（Teams、Slack）以及企業閒置登出機制不會將您標記為離開。單純的保持喚醒功能無法做到這一點。此功能只會在您閒置數秒後才介入，因此在您使用 Mac 或遊戲時絕不會移動游標。預設為關閉；部分受管理的 Mac 可能會偵測到模擬活動。";
"Install a small helper service so closed-display mode and AWDL pausing never ask for your password again. macOS will ask you to allow it in System Settings, once; nothing else changes." = "安裝小型輔助程式服務，讓闔蓋模式與暫停 AWDL 不再要求您輸入密碼。macOS 只會請您在系統設定中允許一次，其他一切都不會改變。";
"One step left, in System Settings: under General ▸ Login Items & Extensions (“Login Items” on older macOS), find Keepresso in the “Allow in the Background” list and turn its switch ON. macOS asks for your administrator password once; this updates by itself when you're done." = "還差一步，請前往系統設定：在「一般 ▸ 登入項目與延伸功能」（較舊版 macOS 為「登入項目」）中，於「允許在背景執行」清單找到 Keepresso 並開啟其開關。macOS 會要求輸入一次系統管理員密碼；完成後此畫面會自動更新。";
"Keeps running with the lid shut and no external display, on power or battery. The display itself still turns off when the lid closes (unless an external display is attached), so it's not lighting up uselessly inside the closed lid. Changing this flips a system setting (pmset disablesleep), so it stays in effect until you turn it off. On battery and closed it can still drain the battery over time, so don't leave it on in a bag. With “Only while brewing” on, Keepresso instead switches it on when a keep-awake session starts and back off when it ends or the app quits. Both need administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (see the top of this tab), otherwise macOS asks for your password (once per app run for “Only while brewing”)." = "即使闔蓋且沒有外接螢幕，也能在使用電源或電池時持續運作。闔蓋時螢幕本身仍會關閉（除非已連接外接螢幕），因此不會在闔起的蓋子裡白白亮著。變更此設定會切換一項系統設定（pmset disablesleep），因此在您關閉前都會持續生效。使用電池且闔蓋時，此功能仍可能隨時間耗盡電量，請勿讓其在背包中保持開啟。開啟「僅在運作時」後，Keepresso 會改為在保持喚醒工作階段開始時開啟此設定，並於工作階段結束或 App 結束時關閉。兩者皆需要系統管理員權限：已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時會靜默執行（請參閱此分頁頂端），否則 macOS 會要求輸入密碼（「僅在運作時」為每次執行 App 時要求一次）。";
"Turns the pause on right now and keeps it on until you turn it off or quit Keepresso (it isn't tied to whether a keep-awake session is brewing). While it's on, AirDrop, Handoff, Sidecar, and Continuity Camera take a break, and the once-a-second lag spikes stop. Everything comes back the moment you turn it off or quit Keepresso; even if the app crashes, macOS is restored automatically. With the administrator helper installed the switch is always instant and silent; without it, macOS asks for your password once per launch (the system dialog may show “osascript”, which is Keepresso running the command)." = "立即開啟暫停功能，並持續開啟直到您將其關閉或結束 Keepresso 為止（與保持喚醒工作階段是否進行中無關）。開啟期間，AirDrop、Handoff、Sidecar 與接續互通相機會暫停運作，每秒一次的延遲突增也會隨之停止。只要您關閉此功能或結束 Keepresso，一切都會立即恢復；即使 App 當機，macOS 也會自動還原設定。已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時，此開關一律即時且無需輸入密碼；未安裝時，macOS 會在每次啟動時要求輸入一次密碼（系統對話方塊可能顯示「osascript」，這是 Keepresso 在執行指令）。";
"Watches for a game (or a cloud-gaming app like GeForce NOW) as the active window and pauses AWDL on its own, then lifts the pause a little after you switch away (the delay below). It only counts while the game is in front and in use, not just running in the background. Without the administrator helper, turning this on asks for your password once per app run, right now rather than mid-game; with the helper it never asks at all. No trigger setup needed: leave this on and forget it." = "監看遊戲（或如 GeForce NOW 等雲端遊戲 App）是否為使用中視窗，並自動暫停 AWDL，之後在您切換離開一段時間後（見下方延遲設定）解除暫停。僅在遊戲位於最前且使用中時才會計入，而非只是在背景執行。若未安裝系統管理員輔助程式，開啟此功能會在每次執行 App 時要求輸入一次密碼，是在現在而非遊戲進行中要求；安裝輔助程式後則完全不會詢問。不需另外設定觸發條件，開啟後即可不再理會。";
"Helper installed. Closed-display mode and AWDL pausing work without password prompts." = "輔助程式已安裝。闔蓋模式與暫停 AWDL 功能皆無需輸入密碼即可運作。";
"Pause AWDL to steady your connection, and test your jitter, in Gaming & Streaming." = "請前往「遊戲與串流」暫停 AWDL 以穩定連線，並測試您的抖動狀況。";
"A small system service that handles the privileged switches (closed-display mode below, AWDL pausing in Gaming & Streaming) for Keepresso, so no password prompts ever again: macOS asks once when you approve it under Login Items, and the approval survives restarts and updates. It can only flip those specific switches, everything it changes is restored if the app quits or crashes, and you can remove it here at any time. It also puts the keepresso command-line tool on your PATH (Homebrew installs already have it). After removal, System Settings can keep showing a stale Login Items row until macOS refreshes its list; the status shown here is the real one." = "一項小型系統服務，負責處理 Keepresso 具特殊權限的開關（下方的闔蓋模式，以及「遊戲與串流」中的暫停 AWDL），從此不再需要輸入密碼：您在「登入項目」中核准時，macOS 只會詢問一次，且此核准可保留至重新開機與更新之後。此服務僅能切換這些特定開關，其所變更的一切都會在 App 結束或當機時還原，您也可以隨時在此移除。此外，它還會將 keepresso 命令列工具加入您的 PATH（透過 Homebrew 安裝的版本已內建此工具）。移除後，系統設定可能仍會顯示過期的登入項目列，直到 macOS 重新整理清單為止；此處顯示的狀態才是實際狀態。";
