"macOS is refusing the helper's registration outright. Reinstall the helper; if that doesn't take, restart the Mac and try once more." = "macOS 完全拒絕輔助程式的註冊要求。請重新安裝輔助程式；若仍無效，請重新開機後再試一次。";
